{"id":"wb-5-137","name":"安迪尔古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安迪尔古城遗址","text":"安迪尔古城，古称唐兰城，位于新疆和田地区民丰县安迪尔村以西20公里处的沙漠中，距离和田市500公里，属汉晋时代的古城遗址，为尼雅古城的姊妹城。古城呈圆形，朝东开有一门，城门宽3.4米，有门两扇。城墙厚2－3米，城内直径约200米，城内建筑密集，但都残损，从城内可采集到棉桃、麦穗和棉织物等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E8%BF%AA%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93217188,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93217188","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6b55d26e2786df9882fe69b8.jpg","title":"Endere_Stupa_BLP467_PHOTO1187_2_172.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Endere_Stupa_BLP467_PHOTO1187_2_172.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Endere_Stupa_BLP467_PHOTO1187_2_172.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Vic Swift","license":"CC BY-SA 1.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/1.0","caption":"Endere stupa, November 2008.","width":320,"height":213}}